This directory contains a vendored, inference-only subset of StarVector.

Upstream: https://github.com/joanrod/star-vector
Paper:    https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11556
Model:    starvector/starvector-1b-im2svg on Hugging Face
License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Copyright (c) ServiceNow Research, Mila, ETS Montreal, and the StarVector
contributors.

Changes from upstream:
- relative imports instead of the top-level `starvector` package;
- removed the training/processor machinery, VQGAN/ConvNeXt/SigLIP branches,
  and the fairscale/omegaconf/taming dependencies;
- the LLM is built from its config (the fine-tuned weights are in the
  StarVector checkpoint) and the SVG tokenizer is loaded from the StarVector
  repository;
- compatibility adjustments for transformers 5.x.

The base language model (`bigcode/starcoderbase-1b`) is distributed under the
BigCode OpenRAIL-M license. See the model card on Hugging Face.
